FINAL ANSWER:
**Short version:** Troy Goode wrote `lib/index.js` and still holds most of it. 23 other people touched it, and almost all of them have 22 surviving lines or fewer.

**Scope of these figures**
- They come from `git blame -w -M -C` on `lib/index.js` at HEAD: 238 lines, all attributed. Copy detection is the default setting (`-C`). The `copy detection` note named no one, and the output flagged no moved or copied code.
- The file has 24 author identities. That drops to 23 people once Troy Goode's two addresses are merged.
- **Reformat commit left out:** `62628c0` "style: reformat js with 4-space indent and double quotes" (Fiona Formatter, 2026-04-12). I confirmed with `git show --stat` that it rewrote 428 lines of this file and 1016 lines across 4 files. Whitespace and quotes were the only changes. The tool leaves it out of the numbers.
  - If it were counted, Fiona Formatter would hold 32 lines (13.4%). Troy Goode would drop to 138 (58.0%) and Douglas Christopher Wilson to 18 (7.6%).
- **Mechanical rewrites:** the tool checked 33 commits that hold surviving lines. It set aside 1 (`62628c0`, above). It flagged 1 more and did not set it aside: `fcd2b56` "issue #42: (WIP) switch to ESLint; clean up" (Troy Goode, 2015-05-28). That commit touched 10 files and changed 30 lines of `lib/index.js`. It has 6 surviving lines. It is a cleanup that goes with an ESLint switch, and I did not re-run without it. Troy Goode is the only person whose figures it would change.
- **Identity merge:** the Troy Goode merge is a guess from names and addresses until you confirm it. The evidence is strong. There is no `.mailmap` in the repo, so nothing is written. The merge exists only in memory for this run.

**Who shaped it**
- **Troy Goode made the first commit on 2013-01-30.** He is the main author through 2016 (28 commits, last one 2016-08-23 under `<email redacted>`). He also made a commit under `troy@laptop.example`, and the last commit by either address is 2026-04-10.
- **2013:** Damien Klinnert, Simon Mansfield, Eric di Domenico and Mathias Buus each made small changes.
- **2014–2015:** Typicode, Alberto Leal, Shane Tomlinson, Igor Soarez, Raymond Feng, max.laverse, DracoBlue and jordandenison each made 1–2 commits. alex94puchades made 5 commits, the last on 2015-05-28.
- **2016–2018:** Douglas Christopher Wilson made 4 commits (last on 2017-10-04). Benjamin Eidelman, Saad Tazi, Hannah Wolfe, Chima Alaebo, Tomek Kopczuk and Tom Arad each made 1 commit.
- **2021:** LuisEGR made 1 commit.

**Whose code is still there** (surviving lines, share of 238)

| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode (2 addresses) | 159 | 66.8% |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 22 | 9.2% |
| alex94puchades | 16 | 6.7% |
| Raymond Feng | 7 | 2.9% |
| LuisEGR | 6 | 2.5% |
| max.laverse | 6 | 2.5% |
